Core Cart Components:

  - Sheet + SheetContent - CartDrawer sliding panel
  - ScrollArea - Cart item list scrolling
  - Button - Add to cart, quantity controls, checkout actions
  - Card + CardContent - CartItem layout structure
  - Badge - Stock status, product variants, promotions
  - Input - Quantity controls, promo codes
  - Separator - Visual dividers in cart sections
  - Skeleton - Loading states for cart items
  - Alert + AlertDescription - Error messages and
  notifications
  - Tooltip - Additional product information
  - Dialog - Cart confirmation modals

  Enhanced Cart Features:

  - Popover + PopoverContent - Quick add variants
  - Select - Size/grind option selection
  - Carousel - Related product suggestions
  - Progress - Shipping threshold indicators
  - Accordion - Expandable cart sections
  - DropdownMenu - Cart actions menu
  - Drawer - Mobile-optimized cart experience

  State Management Integration:

  - Form + FormField - Checkout form handling
  - RadioGroup - Product option selection
  - Checkbox - Terms acceptance, marketing opts
  - Textarea - Order notes and special instructions

  The component architecture is now fully mapped for both
  product listing (Story 2.1) and shopping cart (Story 3.1)
  features, providing a complete foundation for the Honduras
  Coffee e-commerce implementation using shadcn/ui components
   with the claymorphism theme